Dear Riku,

I am sorry, but we have to revise our confirmation of 26 October. One of our =
two moulding presses for the standard grip is down for repair until mid-Novem=
ber, so we can deliver the 180 pcs on 9 Dec 2026, not on 23 Nov 2026.

The revised confirmation SGW-OC-26-1502 Rev. 1 is attached and replaces the e=
arlier one. We apologise for the inconvenience.

Kind regards,

Linh Tran
Export Coordinator
Saigon Grip Works Co., Ltd.
Tan Thuan EPZ, District 7, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam
Tel +84 28 3770 4152 ext. 31 | Mobile +84 90 812 4467
